      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For Tier 1, the hardware must be completely air-gapped and disposable, operating on dedicated, non-networked local mesh systems. Consider using hardened, single-purpose devices that are wiped via hardware-level secure erase before disposal, leaving no recoverable data. Furthermore, employing ephemeral communication methods—where messages are designed to self-destruct immediately upon reading—is crucial for minimizing any residual digital footprint. This approach ensures that even if a device is seized, the communication history itself is nonexistent.",
